118.16% to ₹1,320.50 million.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management noted that revenue growth underscored sustained demand momentum and strong execution across the retail network.","quote":"For FY26, revenue stood at ₹32,029.53 million, reflecting 22.23% growth over the previous fiscal year, underscoring sustained demand momentum and strong execution acrosstheretailnetwork.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e186daf7-9168-4faf-873b-d87ffb129955.pdf"},{"claim":"Gold, symbolizing wealth and prosperity, is integral to Indian culture and ceremonies, ensuring continued demand.","quote":"Gold, symbolizing wealth and prosperity, is integral to Indian culture and ceremonies, ensuring continued demand.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=2ffd92d7-08a1-45e4-8092-7a330c8dd5c4.pdf"},{"claim":"Rising disposable incomes will likely increase spending on luxury items like high-quality, branded jewellery.","quote":"Rising disposable incomes will likely increase spending on luxury items like high-quality, branded jewellery.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=2ffd92d7-08a1-45e4-8092-7a330c8dd5c4.pdf"},{"claim":"India's gems and jewellery market size is expected to reach $119.80 billion by 2027.","quote":"The market was valued at $78.50 billion in 2021 and is expected to reach $119.80 billion by 2027, with a CAGR of 8.34%.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2025-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f3811c28-18ed-46ea-9677-79c38f494801.pdf"},{"claim":"India's middle class is projected to grow from approximately 30% of the population in 2021 to over 60% by 2047.","quote":"India's middle class is projected to grow from ~30% of the population in 2021 to >60% by 2047 (PRICE Market Research Report)